innovations.description:
Pretec e-Disk II+ is an expandable USB flash drive with an embedded 512MB flash memory (default) which can be expanded to 4.5GB by simply inserting an optional SD/MMC card. e-Disk II+ supports both full-size SD/MMC cards and RS-MMC 4.1 (or MMC
Mobile
), and works perfectly with Pretec 133X 4GB SD card and 266X 4GB MMC card to provide users an unprecedented experience of convenient, versatile, high capacity, and high speed mobile data transfer.
